{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "밀라! 안 돼! 미쳤어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "호호! 이게 뭐예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "우와! 신기한 표정이다!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "더 많이 보여주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "그냥 보기만 하니까 너무 지루한걸요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "우리 말썽쟁이, 안녕?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "아직도 부족하신가요? 더 달려보고 싶은가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "밀라한테 뭘 한 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "아직 부족하신가 보네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "그럼 좀 더 놀아볼까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "너…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "작은 테스트부터 해 볼까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "당신의 협응력이 어느 정도인지 확인해 봐요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "행동 패턴도 좀 살펴보고요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "혹시 뭔가 문제가 있을지도 모르잖아요!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "어쩌면 당신은,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "그 몸을 사용할 자격조차 없을지도 모르죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "잘 보세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "어느 쪽을 고르실 건가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "오른쪽 칼이요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "아니면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "왼쪽 칼?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "진심인가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "두 칼이 뭐가 다른가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "그냥 분위기 띄우려고 한 건데!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "됐어요, 칼 같은 건 너무 구식이죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "뭐 상관없어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "더 재미있는 게 생각났는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "일단…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "이게 뭘까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "음악을 들어볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "이 곡은 어때요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "분위기 장난 아니죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "자, 그럼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "규칙을 설명해 드릴게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rule"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "음악이 나올 때만"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "움직일 수 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "음악이 멈추면,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "절대 움직이면 안 돼요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "움직였다간 죽어버릴지도 몰라요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "꼭 결승점까지 가셔야 해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "분명 해내실 수 있을 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "그럼 시작해 볼까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "뭐하고 계세요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "뛰어요! 더 빠르게!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "와아!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "참 잘했어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "완벽한 실험체네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "제가 독차지하고 싶을 정도인걸요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "근데 너무 간단해서 좀 쉬웠죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "그만하고 보내줘!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "게으름 피우면 안 돼요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "아직 할 게임이 많이 남았는걸요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "그래, 그거 해봐요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "제가 지금 눈을 감을 거예요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "눈을 뜨면,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "보이면 안 되는 거 아시죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "이해하셨나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "발견되면, 혼내드려야겠죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "자, 시작할게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "이런 의미 없는…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "이기셨네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "완전 대단해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "근데 이제부터가 진짜예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "몇 배는 더 어려워질 거예요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "어서 숨으세요! 빨리 도망치세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "젠장!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "겨우 빠져나왔어.."}
